<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: SOCCER-U.S. BEAT TRINIDAD &amp; TOBAGO IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-U.S. BEAT TRINIDAD &amp; TOBAGO IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United</p>
<p>States beat Trinidad &amp; Tobago 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a World</p>
<p>Cup Group 1 CONCACAF qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Joe-Max Moore (34th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 8,000</p>
</text>
